["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">引き出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひきだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拉出；取出；抽出；牵出；传唤；带到；拖拽；取（钱）；提款；支取；发挥出；激发；套出（实情等）；问出；得出（结论、结果）；引出；让人出钱；要到钱；哄人掏钱；促使出资</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"118424\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のいいところを<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すようにしなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">试着拿出他最好的一面</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ひげ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">胡须；胡子；络腮胡；面部毛发；（猫等的）胡须；（昆虫等的）触角；（下巴的）毛簇；（K线图的）影线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226759\">お<ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>とう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんがバスルームでひげを<ruby>剃<rp>(</rp><rt>そ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">爸爸在洗手间刮胡子</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">飛行場</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひこうじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">飞行场；机场；航空港</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207492\">その<ruby>島<rp>(</rp><rt>しま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>飛行場<rp>(</rp><rt>ひこうじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>草<rp>(</rp><rt>くさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がぼうぼうだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">岛上的机场现在被杂草覆盖。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">久しぶり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひさしぶり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">久违；阔别已久；许久（未见）；好久不见；许久不见</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"95545\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>久<rp>(</rp><rt>ひさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しぶりに<ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我很久以来第一次接到她的电话</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">非常に</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひじょうに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">非常地；极其；很是</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148973\"><ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>運転<rp>(</rp><rt>うんてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>することは<ruby>非常<rp>(</rp><rt>ひじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>楽<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">开车很有趣</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">引っ越す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひっこす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">搬家；迁居；改变住所</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"182222\"><ruby>去年<rp>(</rp><rt>きょねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>秋<rp>(</rp><rt>あき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはニューヨークに<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っ<ruby>越<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">去年秋天我们搬到了纽约</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n4:v:必要\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">必要</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひつよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">必要；需要</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>必要<rp>(</rp><rt>ひつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这份工作需要英语。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">必</a></span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ひどい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">残忍的；无情的；冷酷的；严酷的；猛烈的；强烈的；剧烈的；沉重的；极端的；非常坏的；糟糕的；可怕的；过分的；离谱的；无理的；过度的；不公平的；不公正的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219294\">この<ruby>薬<rp>(</rp><rt>くすり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はひどい<ruby>味<rp>(</rp><rt>あじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这药太难吃了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">開く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひらく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">打开；拆开；启封；拆包；盛开；展开；铺开；开业；开门；（差距等）扩大；拉开；举办；举行；召开；建立；开创；创办；设立；开设；开放；开通（港口、边境等）；开户；开垦；开辟；开拓；开发；打开（文件等）；（数学）开方；化简（方程）；剖开（鱼）；改写（将汉字改为平假名）；（裙摆等）向外张开；呈喇叭形；（体育）（身体、肩部）打开；姿势松散走样；（围棋）拆；拆边</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125506\"><ruby>庭<rp>(</rp><rt>にわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のバラの<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のつぼみが<ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しずつ<ruby>開<rp>(</rp><rt>ひら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>める。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">渐渐地,我的花园的玫瑰花盆上的芽开始打开。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">昼間</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひるま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">白天；日间；白昼；从日出到日落的时间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197181\">フクロウは<ruby>昼間<rp>(</rp><rt>ひるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>目<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">猫头鹰白天看不到</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">昼休み</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひるやすみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">午休；午间休息；中午休息时间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">拾う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひろう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">捡起；拾取；收集；捡到；拾到（捡起掉落的东西）；选择；挑选；选出；意外获得；碰上（运气、机会等）；侥幸夺得（意外之胜）；侥幸成功；接（人）；用车接送（某人）；招手拦（出租车）；打车；接收；捕捉（信号、声音、干扰等）；勉强回球；接回（难度大的球）；收留；雇用；给予工作机会；收容；步行；徒步</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146484\"><ruby>床<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からペンを<ruby>拾<rp>(</rp><rt>ひろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请从地板上拿起笔</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">美術館</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">びじゅつかん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">美术馆；艺术馆</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220127\">この<ruby>美術館<rp>(</rp><rt>びじゅつかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>入場料<rp>(</rp><rt>にゅうじょうりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は30ドルです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">进博物馆要30美元</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">びっくりする</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">惊讶；惊愕；吃惊；大吃一惊；惊喜（如惊喜派对）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111167\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はびっくりするほどのアクロバットができる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他可以做最惊人的杂技</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">病院</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">びょういん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">医院</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">病</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">病気</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">びょうき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">生病；疾病</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">病</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ビル</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大楼；大厦；多层建筑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ピアノ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">钢琴；弱音；弱奏</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198992\">ナンシーはピアノを<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">南希有钢琴</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ファックス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">传真；传真件；传真机</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234850\">ＦＡＸで<ruby>地図<rp>(</rp><rt>ちず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>送<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていただけませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">您能把地图传真给我吗？ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/346811\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">増える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">增加</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>外国人<rp>(</rp><rt>がいこくじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>観光客<rp>(</rp><rt>かんこうきゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>増<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">外国游客在增加。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">深い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">深；深刻；深远；浓密；厚重；亲密；密切；强烈；浓厚；深；晚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174492\"><ruby>湖<rp>(</rp><rt>みずうみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>深<rp>(</rp><rt>ふか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さはどのくらいですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">湖有多深？ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14089567\" title=\"Tatoeba · jan_OkulaJu\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · jan_OkulaJu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">複雑</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふくざつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">复杂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったより<ruby>複雑<rp>(</rp><rt>ふくざつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个问题比想的复杂。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">復習</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふくしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">复习；温习</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211923\">その<ruby>課<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>復習<rp>(</rp><rt>ふくしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしましたか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你上过课了吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">普通</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふつう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">普通</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n2/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">普</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">太る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふとる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span clas